1
00:00:00,741 --> 00:00:02,691
(Leonard:)-We should call her.
-Yeah.

2
00:00:05,079 --> 00:00:07,489
(Penny:)Amy, it's Penny. Hey.
Just a little heads-up.

3
00:00:07,648 --> 00:00:09,958
(Penny:)Leonard bought a dining room table.

4
00:00:10,651 --> 00:00:12,361
(Penny:)Yeah. Sheldon's breaking up with you.

5
00:00:17,658 --> 00:00:19,768
Amy? Amy?

6
00:00:20,528 --> 00:00:21,698
(Sheldon:)Amy?

7
00:00:22,463 --> 00:00:23,943
(Sheldon:)I'll get right to the point.

8
00:00:24,098 --> 00:00:27,268
(Sheldon:)I think we need to end this
relationship, so....

9
00:00:27,435 --> 00:00:30,105
(Sheldon:)Just sign this
with your finger, and...

10
00:00:30,271 --> 00:00:34,621
(Sheldon:)Please don't cry on my iPad.
I didn't get AppleCare.

11
00:00:35,776 --> 00:00:37,776
(Amy:)I'm not surprised you want
to end the relationship.

12
00:00:37,945 --> 00:00:40,485
(Amy:)I'm a little surprised
you didn't get AppleCare.

13
00:00:41,883 --> 00:00:44,223
(Amy:)Anyway, enjoy your life.
Where do I sign?

14
00:00:44,385 --> 00:00:46,055
(Sheldon:)At the bottom. I must say,

15
00:00:46,220 --> 00:00:48,700
(Sheldon:)I'm relieved you're not making
more of a scene out of this.

16
00:00:48,856 --> 00:00:50,236
(Amy:)I've already moved on.

17
00:00:50,358 --> 00:00:53,338
(Amy:)Besides, this breakup has
nothing to do with me.

18
00:00:53,394 --> 00:00:54,394
(Sheldon:)It doesn't?

19
00:00:54,562 --> 00:00:56,632
(Amy:)Of course not.
This is just Leonard

20
00:00:56,797 --> 00:00:59,177
(Amy:)trying to take the focus
off that dreadful table

